-        $$ w_{\text{dir}} = \frac{\hat{p}_{\text{dir}}(\mathbf{u}^{\text{dir}})}{\hat{p}_{\text{light}}(\mathbf{u}^{\text{dir}}) + \hat{p}_{\text{dir}}(\mathbf{u}^{\text{dir}})} $$
